<title>USA: Mount Pleasant, N.Y., $2.250 mln won by Fleet.</title>
<headline>Mount Pleasant, N.Y., $2.250 mln won by Fleet.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fleet Securities Inc. said it won $2.250 million of Mount Pleasant, N.Y., public improvement bonds, 1996 Series C, with a net interest cost of 5.5810 percent.</p>
